+++ b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed HTTPS proxies to use ``proxy_ssl_context`` instead of ``ssl_context``
+when establishing the TLS connection to the proxy in forwarding mode
+(``use_forwarding_for_https=True``).
